---
import { sitePath } from '../lib/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const services = [
  { n: '01', title: 'Project management', text: 'Disciplined support from planning to close-out. Clear control of scope, schedule, cost and risk throughout the project lifecycle.', details: ['Project schedules, milestones and recovery actions', 'Budget monitoring, risk tracking and change awareness', 'Management reporting, commissioning and close-out support'], tags: 'Planning & scheduling · Cost control · Project reporting' },
  { n: '02', title: 'Engineering coordination', text: 'Bringing technical teams, contractors and suppliers into alignment, with practical follow-through across every critical interface.', details: ['Multidisciplinary engineering and contractor interfaces', 'Procurement alignment, vendor follow-up and delivery priorities', 'Site progress, completion documentation and handover readiness'], tags: 'Vendor coordination · Site interfaces · Handover readiness' },
  { n: '03', title: 'Business development', text: 'A structured route into regional energy markets, connecting market understanding with focused commercial action.', details: ['Market research, feasibility assessments and entry strategy', 'End-user and EPC mapping, registration and prequalification', 'Opportunity scouting, partner identification and commercial introductions'], tags: 'Market entry · Vendor prequalification · Partner scouting' }
];
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="small-line"></span> DUBAI BASED. REGIONALLY FOCUSED.</p><h1>Project discipline.<br />Regional insight.<br /><em>Progress delivered.</em></h1><p class="hero-intro">Project management, engineering coordination and business development for the energy sector. Connecting ambition with execution across the Middle East and Africa.</p><a class="button" href="#expertise">Explore our expertise <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="hero-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Independent expertise. Integrated support.</div></div>
    <div class="hero-visual"><img src={sitePath('images/region.webp')} width="1174" height="688" alt="Illustrated satellite view of Africa, the Middle East and the Arabian Peninsula" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="visual-top"><span>OUR PERSPECTIVE</span><span>25.20° N / 55.27° E</span></div><div class="visual-bottom"><span class="visual-label">Local understanding.<br />A wider perspective.</span><span class="visual-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="sector-bar"><div class="wrap"><span>FOCUSED ON ENERGY</span><p>Oil & gas <i>·</i> Onshore & offshore <i>·</i> Energy infrastructure</p><span>MIDDLE EAST & AFRICA</span></div></div>
  <section id="about" class="wrap section about"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / WHO WE ARE</p><h2>A focused extension<br />of your team.</h2><div class="identity"><img src={sitePath('images/mina-logo.png')} width="480" height="558" alt="MINA Consulting and Engineering — gold oil drop and black derrick logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><p>Professional integrity.<br />Practical support.<br />Long-term relationships.</p></div></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="lead">Complex projects need clear direction. We bring the structure, coordination and regional understanding to keep them moving.</p><p>MINA Consulting and Engineering is a Dubai-based consultancy serving the oil and gas sector across the Middle East and Africa. We work alongside owners, operators, EPC contractors and suppliers to strengthen project delivery and support commercial growth.</p><p>Our approach combines technical understanding with commercial awareness, practical governance and disciplined follow-through. Each assignment is tailored to the client’s organisation, contractual framework and project maturity.</p><p>Our mission is to provide reliable, practical and results-oriented project management that helps energy-sector clients execute safely and efficiently, with clear control over scope, schedule, cost, quality and stakeholder interfaces.</p><p>We help management understand priorities, anticipate constraints and turn project information into timely action. Integrity, confidentiality and long-term client relationships underpin that work.</p></div></section>
  <section id="expertise" class="expertise"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / OUR EXPERTISE</p><h2>From opportunity<br />to execution.</h2></div><p>Three connected capabilities.<br />One focused regional partner.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map(service => <article class="service"><span class="service-number">{service.n}</span><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.text}</p><ul class="service-details">{service.details.map(detail => <li>{detail}</li>)}</ul><div class="service-tags">{service.tags}</div></article>)}</div><div class="delivery-feature"><figure><img src={sitePath('images/refinery.jpg')} width="1400" height="933" alt="Processing towers and pipework at an oil refinery beside the water" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Oil & gas infrastructure · Illustrative industry photography</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">DISCIPLINE THROUGHOUT DELIVERY</p><h3>Safety, quality and a clear path to completion.</h3><p>We support upstream developments, onshore and offshore facilities, gas processing, pipelines, refining and brownfield upgrades. Across these environments, health, safety, environmental responsibility and quality are fundamental to successful delivery.</p><p>Our approach promotes clear responsibilities, effective reporting and disciplined document control, with attention to client requirements, project procedures and contractual obligations.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section id="region" class="wrap section region"><div class="region-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / OUR REACH</p><h2>Rooted in Dubai.<br /><em>Connected to the region.</em></h2><p>Our UAE base provides a strategic platform for supporting projects throughout the Gulf and connecting clients, contractors and supply chains with opportunities across African energy markets.</p><p>For manufacturers, engineering companies, technology providers and specialist service companies, MINA brings project-execution support and commercial market development together through a single regional interface.</p><p>We help clients understand market structures, identify decision-makers, position their products and services, and develop a practical route to market. Market intelligence and focused follow-up connect regional opportunities with commercial action.</p><div class="region-chips"><span>United Arab Emirates</span><span>Middle East</span><span>Africa</span></div></div><div class="approach"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</p><div><span>01</span><p><strong>Establish clarity</strong>Define objectives, responsibilities and realistic milestones.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><strong>Maintain control</strong>Coordinate interfaces and monitor progress, risks and priorities.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><strong>Turn insight into action</strong>Support timely decisions with concise reporting and proactive follow-up.</p></div><p class="approach-note">From the first scope discussion to the closure of outstanding issues, we focus on accountability, early identification of constraints and clear decision paths.</p></div><figure class="region-photo"><img src={sitePath('images/dubai.jpg')} width="1400" height="933" alt="Dubai skyline and the Burj Khalifa illuminated at sunset" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Dubai, United Arab Emirates · Our regional base</figcaption></figure></section>
  <section id="contact" class="contact"><div class="wrap contact-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / GET IN TOUCH</p><h2>Let’s move<br /><em>your project forward.</em></h2><p>For project support or a conversation about your<br class="desktop-break" /> next step in the region, contact us directly.</p></div><address><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:info@mina-consulting.com">info@mina-consulting.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Meydan Grandstand, 6th Floor<br />Meydan Road, Naad Al Sheba<br />Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p></address></div></section>
</Layout>
